WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.982
Vendors lists everyone you buy parts from.

00:00:03.435 --> 00:00:06.001
Click a vendor to see their details and parts.

00:00:08.743 --> 00:00:12.481
Click Add vendor to add a new one, or edit an existing one.

00:00:12.934 --> 00:00:15.442
Use Import to load the vendor Excel file.
